@startuml
actor Player
participant PlayerCombat
participant "Weapon and hit query" as Weapon
participant Health
participant EventBus
Player -> PlayerCombat : Fire while gameplay owns control
PlayerCombat -> PlayerCombat : Check ammo cooldown and busy state
PlayerCombat -> Weapon : Consume round and resolve eligible hit
Weapon -> Health : Apply valid bullet damage
Health -> Health : Resolve protection and death
PlayerCombat -> EventBus : Publish attack and noise events
PlayerCombat --> Player : Update ammo recoil and feedback
@enduml
